\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Seven contiguous tetrahedral face cells. Orange and cyan arrows show the local tangent basis, green arrows show outward normals, black rails show external structural seams, and the transparent lateral triangles converge to the common bonding hub / Sete células tetraédricas contíguas. As setas laranja e ciano mostram a base tangente local, as verdes mostram as normais externas, os trilhos pretos mostram as juntas estruturais externas e os triângulos laterais transparentes convergem ao hub comum de equipotencialização.\relax }}{9}{figure.caption.9}%
